---
---Asks the customer for more information, as the merchant. Allowed up to 3 times per case before you must accept or deny it.
---
---`POST /resolution_center_cases/{id}/request_info`
---Errors: Conflict.
---@param input whop.resolution_center_cases.RequestResolutionCenterCaseInfoRequest
